---
title: "deposit (Pebble Protocol: Lending Entry Points)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_version: ensure_version_matches()
    q_version --> q_validate_market: validate_market(market)
    q_validate_market --> q_circuit_break: check circuit_break
    q_circuit_break --> q_error_cb: circuit_break triggered
    q_error_cb --> [*]: abort market_under_circuit_break
    q_circuit_break --> q_timestamp: now = clock.timestamp_ms() / 1000
    q_timestamp --> q_get_amount: deposit_amount = coin.value()
    q_get_amount --> q_handle_mint: handle_mint(obligation_id, coin, now)
    q_handle_mint --> q_update_reward: update_obligation_reward_manager(deposit_reward_type)
    q_update_reward --> q_emit: emit DepositEvent
    q_emit --> [*]: return

    note right of q_handle_mint
        INV-001: coin.value() must be non-zero
        INV-002: deposit must not breach max_deposit_amount limit
        INV-003: obligation must belong to this market
        INV-004: cannot deposit same asset that is borrowed
        INV-005: deposit rate limiter outflow is reduced
    end note
